# Keep the line endings this project relies on.
#
# The generator writes every CP2K input, shell script and .ssv table with LF (a
# CRLF shebang is "command not found" on the cluster), so the repository stores
# text as LF and checks it out as LF - on Windows too.  Only the .cmd launcher
# keeps CRLF, because cmd.exe is happiest with it.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Data files: no diff noise, no conversion.
*.json binary
*.png  binary
*.exe  binary
